&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company&amp;nbsp;Introduction&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did we ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we’re collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar e-commerce industry from the ground up. We are one of the fastest-growing e-commerce companies that established an unparalleled reputation for being a dominant and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&amp;nbsp;Overview&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Senior Software Development Manager to lead a team of 8–10 engineers working on next-generation platform capabilities within Coupang’s transportation ecosystem. This role will focus on re-architecting systems for global use cases, enabling scalable and standardized solutions across regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead one of the key initiatives in rebuilding foundational platform services, driving both technical direction and team development. The platform operates at massive scale, supporting tens of millions of transactions daily and impacting every shipment processed within Coupang’s ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;have&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;opportunity&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;critical&amp;nbsp;initiative&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;re-architecting&amp;nbsp;transportation&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;grow&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;India,&amp;nbsp;owning&amp;nbsp;end-to-end&amp;nbsp;delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;high-scale,&amp;nbsp;event-driven&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;processing&amp;nbsp;30–40&amp;nbsp;million&amp;nbsp;transactions&amp;nbsp;daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;distributed&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;challenges&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;every&amp;nbsp;shipment&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You&amp;nbsp;Will&amp;nbsp;Do&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead,&amp;nbsp;hire,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;grow&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;8–10&amp;nbsp;engineers,&amp;nbsp;setting&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;high&amp;nbsp;bar&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;performance&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;career&amp;nbsp;development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;execution&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;key&amp;nbsp;platform&amp;nbsp;initiative&amp;nbsp;focused&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;re-architecting&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;use&amp;nbsp;cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break&amp;nbsp;down&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;problem&amp;nbsp;statements&amp;nbsp;into&amp;nbsp;clear&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;designs&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;execution&amp;nbsp;plans,&amp;nbsp;partnering&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;senior&amp;nbsp;engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own&amp;nbsp;end-to-end&amp;nbsp;delivery,&amp;nbsp;ensuring&amp;nbsp;projects&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;executed&amp;nbsp;efficiently&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;strong&amp;nbsp;planning,&amp;nbsp;tracking,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply&amp;nbsp;strong&amp;nbsp;program&amp;nbsp;management&amp;nbsp;practices&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;risk&amp;nbsp;identification,&amp;nbsp;mitigation,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;stakeholder&amp;nbsp;communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate&amp;nbsp;cross-functionally&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;align&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;priorities&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;drive&amp;nbsp;large-scale&amp;nbsp;initiatives&amp;nbsp;forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;evolve&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;event-driven,&amp;nbsp;highly&amp;nbsp;scalable&amp;nbsp;system&amp;nbsp;processing&amp;nbsp;tens&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;millions&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;daily&amp;nbsp;transactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;high-performance&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;culture&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;focus&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;accountability,&amp;nbsp;ownership,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;continuous&amp;nbsp;improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic&amp;nbsp;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+&amp;nbsp;years&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;software&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;3+&amp;nbsp;years&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;background&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Java&amp;nbsp;backend&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;distributed&amp;nbsp;systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;managing&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;10+&amp;nbsp;engineers&amp;nbsp;through&amp;nbsp;full&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;relational&amp;nbsp;databases&amp;nbsp;(MySQL,&amp;nbsp;Aurora,&amp;nbsp;TiDB)&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;NoSQL&amp;nbsp;(DynamoDB)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;event-driven&amp;nbsp;architectures&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;streaming&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;(Kafka,&amp;nbsp;Flink,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;Spark)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track&amp;nbsp;record&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;delivering&amp;nbsp;large-scale,&amp;nbsp;high-reliability&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;communication&amp;nbsp;skills&amp;nbsp;—&amp;nbsp;ability&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;translate&amp;nbsp;between&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;stakeholders&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Computer&amp;nbsp;Science&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;equivalent&amp;nbsp;practical&amp;nbsp;experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&amp;nbsp;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;large-scale&amp;nbsp;distributed&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;event-driven&amp;nbsp;systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;e-commerce,&amp;nbsp;transportation,&amp;nbsp;logistics,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;platform&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;building&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;re-architecting&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;track&amp;nbsp;record&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;driving&amp;nbsp;cross-team&amp;nbsp;initiatives&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;fast-paced&amp;nbsp;environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;hiring&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;scaling&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;high-growth&amp;nbsp;setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Hybrid work model: Coupang hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration that acts a catalyst to enrich the experience of employees. Employees are required to work at least 3 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 2 days a week, depending on the role requirement. Some businesses may require more time in office due to nature of work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;consider&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Those&amp;nbsp;eligible&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;employment&amp;nbsp;protection&amp;nbsp;(recipients&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;veteran’s&amp;nbsp;benefits,&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;disabled,&amp;nbsp;etc.)&amp;nbsp;may&amp;nbsp;receive&amp;nbsp;preferential&amp;nbsp;treatment&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;employment&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;accordance&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;applicable&amp;nbsp;laws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy&amp;nbsp;Notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your&amp;nbsp;personal&amp;nbsp;information&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;collected&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;managed&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;Coupang&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;stated&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Application&amp;nbsp;Privacy&amp;nbsp;Notice&amp;nbsp;located&amp;nbsp;below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.coupang.com/en/land/jobs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://privacy.coupang.com/en/land/jobs/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
